OL,3,AMet chief warns policing 'heading for
OL,4,Afailure' without reform
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe police system in England and Wales
OL,7,Fcannot cope against sophisticated
OL,8,Fmodern criminals without urgent reform,
OL,9,Fthe head of the Metropolitan Police has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,12,FIn a speech on Friday, Sir Mark Rowley
OL,13,Fargued the system was "heading for
OL,14,Ffailure" without change.
OL,16,FHe is proposing eight to 10 regional
OL,17,Fpolice forces, supported by hundreds of
OL,18,Flocal policing commands and a new
OL,19,Fnational force, in what would be the
OL,20,Fbiggest overhaul of policing since the
OL,21,F1960s.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,303,300,200,140,0,100
