OL,3,ARussell Brand being investigated over
OL,4,Arape allegations from two more women,
OL,5,Apolice say
OL,6,
OL,7,FMore victims are likely to come forward
OL,8,Ffollowing his conviction, the detective
OL,9,Fwho led the police investigation has
OL,10,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
