OL,3,ATwo dead after bus crashes in France,
OL,4,Aofficials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FOne child and one young adult have died
OL,7,Fafter a bus crashed in eastern France,
OL,8,Flocal authorities have said.
OL,10,FThe bus was travelling between Lyon and
OL,11,FBourg-en-Bresse when it crashed at
OL,12,Faround 07:00 local time on Friday in
OL,13,Fthe town of Lent, around 34 miles
OL,14,F(55km) from the border with
OL,15,FSwitzerland.
OL,17,FThe town's mayor Yves Cristin told
OL,18,FFrench media the bus "left the road and
OL,19,Fhit a tree in the ditch".
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/39
