OL,3,ATwo dead after bus crashes in France,
OL,4,Aofficials say
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bus was carrying 43 passengers,
OL,7,Fincluding 15 children, the
OL,8,FBourg-en-Bresse prosecutor's office
OL,9,Fsaid. Three people are in a critical
OL,10,Fcondition and a further 13 have
OL,11,Fsustained minor injuries.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
